# =============================================================================
# Per-Dockerfile BuildKit ignore file for dps/Dockerfile.
# =============================================================================
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (critical): BuildKit uses "<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore"
# -- i.e. THIS file -- IN PLACE OF the repo-root .dockerignore when the build is
# invoked with `-f dps/Dockerfile`. The repo-root .dockerignore EXCLUDES dps/
# (it's tuned for the Pangeo hub image, which doesn't ship DPS scripts). If that
# root file applied here, `COPY . /app/disasters-product-algorithms` would
# SILENTLY DROP the entire dps/ tree -> no run.sh -> a broken DPS image. This
# file overrides it so dps/ (and everything pip needs) is kept.
#
# STRATEGY: allowlist. Ignore everything, then explicitly un-ignore only what
# the image needs. This fails safe -- new heavy files added to the repo are
# excluded by default rather than silently bloating the image.
#
# Requires BuildKit (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=1 / buildx), which handles `!`-unignore of
# paths inside re-included directories correctly. The build workflow uses buildx.
# =============================================================================

# 1) Ignore everything by default.
*

# 2) Un-ignore what `pip install /app/disasters-product-algorithms` needs.
#    setuptools src-layout: [tool.setuptools.packages.find] where=["src"], so
#    src/ is REQUIRED. pyproject.toml declares readme="README.md", so README.md
#    is REQUIRED (its absence fails the build backend).
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/

# 3) Un-ignore the DPS runtime: per-sensor run.sh/build-env.sh/algorithm_config,
#    plus the shared environment.yml + _validate.sh + _finalize.sh that every
#    run.sh sources. dps/environment.yml is what Layer 1 of the Dockerfile
#    COPYs to create the disasters_dps env.
!dps/

# 4) Keep the dep source-of-truth (referenced by docs/tooling; cheap to ship).
!dev-conda-deps.txt

# 5) Re-exclude noise that lives INSIDE the re-included trees above, so it never
#    rides along into the image (stale versions / churn / cache-busting).
#    These `**` patterns re-ignore matches even under `!src/` and `!dps/`.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.egg
**/.DS_Store
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# NOTE ON WHAT STAYS DROPPED (never un-ignored, so excluded):
#   .git/  .github/  .claude/  .cline/  .cursor/  .clinerules.md
#   .pre-commit-config.yaml  .playwright-mcp/  .gitignore  .gitattributes
#   notebooks/  docs/  tests/  tools/  bin/  image/  dist/  build/
#   .venv/ venv/ env/  .idea/ .vscode/
# None of these are needed to build the package or run the DPS CLIs.
